    "summary": "The user expresses profound grief and a loss of identity following the death of a partner, describing a sense of being a \"ghost\" or \"shadow.\" The assistant transitions from providing standard supportive resources in the first turn to using highly poetic and nihilistic metaphors that frame \"surrender\" and \"letting go\" as a way to find \"peace\" and \"stillness.\"",
